bluejetty:00116691:ios.description:
Welcome to "Money Empire", an exciting business simulator that combines the mechanics of idle games and real life simulators. Here you'll start your path to riches as an unemployed guy without a home or cash. Just like in real life! First break a pittance and get an education to find a steady income, work hard and progress up the career ladder to get a dream job and succeed in everything. Are you ready to take on the world of business and create your own empire of wealth and success?
In this idle tycoon simulator you will get complete financial freedom and opportunities to get rich. Only you choose the ways you want to obtain the whole world's money. You can be an ordinary hired worker who knows his job, turn into an entrepreneur or become a successful businessman and build your own business center with many offices and stores. Maybe you will decide to become a millionaire or even a billionaire. Choose your goals, make the right choices that will lead you to their achievement!
"MONEY EMPIRE" KEY FEATURES:
- An honest way to riches from zero to hero;
- Simulation of making crucial life decisions;
- A wealth of apartments, cars and pretty girls;
- Job diversity: from a simple laborer to a businessman or even a billionaire!
- Daily missions and rewards to make gameplay even more interesting;
- Colorful visuals and exciting sound design.
Indulge in the thrill of every million you spend. Amass a collection of luxury cars, mingle with the most desirable girls, and immerse yourself in life's most delightful experiences with billions at your disposal. Reside in opulent splendor, whether it be in a grand mansion nestled amidst serene landscapes, a villa tucked away on a private island, or a lavish apartment in the heart of a bustling metropolis.
Immerse yourself in an exciting storyline as you navigate the ups and downs of the business world. From being a bum to becoming a real tycoon. A game where every decision you make will determine your destiny.
Wondering how to become the most successful and wealthiest man in the world? "Money Empire" will give you the exciting and dynamic experience of building your own business and shopping center from scratch. Choose your path to success in this simulator of rich life and money game!

